#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/wrap-up.rst:2
msgid "Wrap up"
msgstr "小结"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/wrap-up.rst:4
msgid ""
"The IDE in one paragraph: scripts are edited in a professional editor that "
"knows the camera's API, run on the camera with one button, and observed "
"through three live instruments -- the frame buffer viewer for what the "
"camera sees, the histogram for the numbers behind it, and the serial "
"terminal for what the script says. Around that loop sit the maintenance "
"tools that keep a camera's firmware, filesystem, and ROMFS in order; the "
"machine-vision tools that produce the artifacts scripts consume -- threshold"
" tuples, cleaned descriptors, printed tags, converted models, labelled "
"datasets; and the power tools that look under the hood when performance "
"matters."
msgstr ""
"一段话概括 IDE：脚本在一个了解摄像头 API "
"的专业编辑器中编辑，用一个按钮在摄像头上运行，并通过三种实时仪表来观察——用于查看摄像头所见的帧缓冲区查看器、用于查看其背后数值的直方图，以及用于查看脚本所述内容的串行终端。围绕这个循环的，是让摄像头的固件、文件系统和"
" ROMFS "
"保持有序的维护工具；产出脚本所消费产物的机器视觉工具——阈值元组、清理后的描述符、打印的标签、转换的模型、带标签的数据集；以及在性能至关重要时深入底层探查的强力工具。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/wrap-up.rst:18
msgid "Where to go from here:"
msgstr "接下来该看哪里："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/wrap-up.rst:20
msgid ""
"The :doc:`examples menu <scripts-and-examples>` is the standing answer to "
"\"how do I do X on the camera\" -- nearly every library feature has a "
"runnable example."
msgstr ""
":doc:`示例菜单 <scripts-and-examples>` 是对“我如何在摄像头上做 "
"X”这一问题的常备答案——几乎每一项库功能都有一个可运行的示例。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/wrap-up.rst:24
msgid ""
"The :doc:`library reference </library/index>` documents every module the "
"completion popup offers."
msgstr ":doc:`库参考 </library/index>` 记录了补全弹出窗口所提供的每一个模块。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/wrap-up.rst:26
msgid ""
"The :doc:`openmv Python package <../openmv-py/index>` drives a camera from "
"host-side Python scripts -- the IDE's debug protocol without the IDE -- for "
"test rigs, automation, and custom desktop frontends."
msgstr ""
":doc:`openmv Python 包 <../openmv-py/index>` 可从主机端 Python 脚本驱动摄像头——即不依赖 IDE 的"
" IDE 调试协议——适用于测试装置、自动化以及自定义桌面前端。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/wrap-up.rst:30
msgid ""
"The :doc:`production chapter <../../production/index>` picks up where the "
"IDE's deploy step leaves off: baking scripts into the firmware, shipping "
"assets in ROMFS, and hardening a camera for the field."
msgstr ""
":doc:`生产章节 <../../production/index>` 接续 IDE 部署步骤的尽头：将脚本烘焙进固件、在 ROMFS "
"中发布资源，以及为现场使用加固摄像头。"
